          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Brutal Blow"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The spinesnapper makes a claw or weapon Strike. If it hits, in addition to dealing damage, the creature must attempt a 22 Fortitude saving throw, with the following effects.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected and the spinesnapper is flat-footed until the start of its next turn.\n- **Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Failure:** The creature is pushed 10 feet.\n- **Critical Failure:** The target is pushed 10 feet and knocked prone."
            },
