            "action_name": {
              "value": "Choke Slam"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: The spinesnapper has a creature grabbed or restrained\n\nFrequency: 1/round\n\nThe spinesnapper slams the creature against a nearby surface. The target and the surface struck each take 4d6 bludgeoning damage, and the target must succeed at a 22 Fortitude save or become slowed 1 for 1 round, or stunned for 1 round on a critical failure."
